{"4593930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FOAMGRAVE", "steam_appid": 4593930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOAMGRAVE</strong> is a multiplayer open-world ocean survival sandbox set in a distant future where the planet has been swallowed by water. Start with a basic boat and survive by trading, fighting, looting, and upgrading your vessel as you navigate a dangerous sea filled with floating settlements, pirates, transport ships, and rival players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 <strong>THE OCEAN TOOK EVERYTHING. NOW IT'S ALL THAT'S LEFT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no land. No cities. No escape. Only an endless, violent ocean filled with wreckage, survivors… and predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but a fragile boat. What you become is up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚓ <strong>A WORLD WITHOUT LAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/1a67ce4df70f30deaa1fc4e1e3bca976.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/1a67ce4df70f30deaa1fc4e1e3bca976.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/1a67ce4df70f30deaa1fc4e1e3bca976.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOAMGRAVE drops you into a fully ocean-covered world where survival means staying afloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drift through abandoned ship graveyards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dock at floating settlements barely holding together</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for loot in dangerous, contested waters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face storms that can end your run in seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ocean is not a backdrop. <strong>It is the map. It is the threat. It is the game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚤 <strong>UPGRADE YOUR BOAT OR SINK WITH IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/85c3584437bb280cee7ae01494f3bd08.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/85c3584437bb280cee7ae01494f3bd08.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/85c3584437bb280cee7ae01494f3bd08.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your boat is your life. Start small, stay vulnerable, improve or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade <strong>engines, hull, and handling</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount <strong>weapons for defense… or domination</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand cargo to risk bigger hauls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your vessel into a <strong>fast raider, armored tank, or trading beast</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>REAL RISK. REAL LOSS.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/872a7b87e23b3475fc646e5060ff67af.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/872a7b87e23b3475fc646e5060ff67af.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/872a7b87e23b3475fc646e5060ff67af.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no second chances. Every trip into open water can turn into a fight for everything you brought with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation-based loot loss</strong> - risk your cargo, gold, ammo, and hard-earned progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack or be hunted by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambush convoys or become one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape with everything… or lose it all in seconds</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter matters. Every decision has weight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >☠️ <strong>CHOOSE WHO YOU BECOME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/a68f5dcfab8982d583c7739e448f7125.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/a68f5dcfab8982d583c7739e448f7125.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/a68f5dcfab8982d583c7739e448f7125.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no classes. No fixed path. Your actions shape how the world reacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>ruthless pirate</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a reputation as a <strong>trusted trader</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play both sides… until it catches up to you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌐 <strong>A PLAYER-DRIVEN OCEAN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/c55c478b286af3ee4cbabdbb855a055d.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/c55c478b286af3ee4cbabdbb855a055d.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/c55c478b286af3ee4cbabdbb855a055d.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Host a private server, sail with friends, or open the waters to everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic encounters with <strong>real players and roaming threats</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own version of the world through server-hosted play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scripted path. No safety net.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌪️ <strong>MOMENTS THAT DEFINE YOU</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot a distant ship… and decide whether to chase or hide</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return from a long run overloaded with loot, heart racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught in a fight you can't win… and try to escape with scraps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose everything… and start again, smarter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is survival driven by tension, not timers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 <strong>WHY FOAMGRAVE IS DIFFERENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌊 <strong>100% ocean world</strong> — no land, no filler</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Full-risk gameplay</strong> — every trip matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚤 <strong>Boat-focused progression</strong> — your vessel is your identity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌐 <strong>Player-driven stories</strong> — no two encounters are the same</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⭐ <strong>WISHLIST NOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/de3cd1635d7c92299516a6f63a8c47ab.poster.avif?t=1786130585\" width=352 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/de3cd1635d7c92299516a6f63a8c47ab.webm?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4593930/extras/de3cd1635d7c92299516a6f63a8c47ab.mp4?t=1786130585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like high-risk survival games, naval combat, and player-driven sandbox worlds, <strong>FOAMGRAVE is built for you.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FOAMGRAVE</strong> is a multiplayer open-world ocean survival sandbox set in a distant future where the planet has been swallowed by water. Start with a basic boat and survive by trading, fighting, looting, and upgrading your vessel as you navigate a dangerous sea filled with floating settlements, pirates, transport ships, and rival players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 <strong>THE OCEAN TOOK EVERYTHING. NOW IT'S ALL THAT'S LEFT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no land. No cities. No escape. Only an endless, violent ocean filled with wreckage, survivors… and predators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing but a fragile boat. What you become is up 